  "notes": "A weaponskill-NM quest with a hole in the middle. Bullet 2 says you must break the latent on the Gun of Trials before the rest of the quest, and the page then opens a '== Breaking the Latent ==' section that renders to a bare horizontal rule -- the front matter flags this page as a transclusion, and that is what was transcluded. So the requirement is real and stated but the method is simply absent from the page. It is kept as step 2 rather than demoted to a note because it genuinely sits between two Cid steps and the page really does put it there; it carries no target, no zone and no evidence, because none is knowable from what is here. That gap is why the quest is medium rather than high.\n\nStep 1 grants BOTH the Weapon training guide key item and the Gun of Trials. Only the key item is used as evidence: the gun is traded away at step 3, so an AND-list over both would read false for the rest of the quest. Bullet 4's four sub-bullets are two alternative routes into The Boyahda Tree and are route advice, not steps -- the instruction in that bullet is the single examine at (J-8). 'Map 3' is a wiki map page, not a zone. Bullet 6 is a second examine of the SAME ??? after the kill, which is why steps 4, 5 and 6 are three rungs on one object. 'Quest Reqs: Marksmanship Skill 250+' has no slot in the schema and nothing in the packets reports skill, so it is flagged and gates nothing; the level 71 half of it is the header Level field and is kept.",
